[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2102.15, "timestamp": "00:35:02", "text": "あるいは、セックスが超サイコパス的とか、そういう感じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2104.31, "timestamp": "00:35:04", "text": "。 いいえ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2106.79, "timestamp": "00:35:06", "text": "セラピーを受けたり、みんなが何かしら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2110.23, "timestamp": "00:35:10", "text": "問題を抱えていると考えるのは全く問題ありません。 私たちは皆、人間だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2113.19, "timestamp": "00:35:13", "text": "もちろん、私たちは皆間違いを犯しますし、私たち"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2116.31, "timestamp": "00:35:16", "text": "全員が、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2122.39, "timestamp": "00:35:22", "text": "戦わなければならない悪魔との戦いを経験しますよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2124.15, "timestamp": "00:35:24", "text": "ええ、そうですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2128.069, "timestamp": "00:35:28", "text": "ですから、もし助けが必要な場合は、誰かに相談する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2132.87, "timestamp": "00:35:32", "text": "か、適切な訓練を受けた人に相談してください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2134.87, "timestamp": "00:35:34", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2138.069, "timestamp": "00:35:38", "text": "私のアドバイスとしては、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2138.589, "timestamp": "00:35:38", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yeah I get it"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2140.15, "timestamp": "00:35:40", "text": "寂しさを感じた時はいつでも、気を紛らわせることです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2143.109, "timestamp": "00:35:43", "text": "。   自分が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2146.55, "timestamp": "00:35:46", "text": "楽しめることをすればいいんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2153.109, "timestamp": "00:35:53", "text": "もちろん私たちの人生で常にドリーのような状態が続くわけではありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2156.71, "timestamp": "00:35:56", "text": "。 さあ、私たちを救ってくれるヒーローの登場だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2159.43, "timestamp": "00:35:59", "text": "、そうだろ？   ある"}]